      "title": "ABSLAMC: Dividend Plans And Margin Assumptions Will Shape Fair Outlook",
      "body": "Analysts have raised the price target for Aditya Birla Sun Life AMC from about ₹937 to about ₹986. This change reflects updated views on slightly higher discount rates, a revised revenue growth outlook, firmer profit margins and a higher assumed future P/E multiple.",
