    {
      "id": "8b10d166-18fa-456c-bb55-7dd8aa4701f3",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-04-24T11:48:12.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues miss analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹33.76 (up from ₹32.26 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹20.6b (up 3.9% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹9.75b (up 4.8% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 47% (in line with FY 2025). Revenue missed analyst estimates by 2.1%. Earnings per share (EPS) also missed analyst estimates by 4.5%. Revenue is forecast to grow 9.2% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 16% growth forecast for the Capital Markets industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 17% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 47% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
