      "body": "Aditya Birla Sun Life AMC Limited Recommendation of final dividend of INR 25.50/- per equity share of INR 5/- each of the Company for the financial year ended March 31, 2026, subject to the approval of shareholders at the ensuing Annual General Meeting (AGM). The final dividend, if approved by the shareholders, will be paid within thirty days from the conclusion of AGM. Record date for the purpose of determining Shareholders eligible to receive final dividend, shall be intimated separately.",
