      "body": "Analysts have lifted the price target for Aditya Birla Sun Life AMC from about ₹914 to roughly ₹937, pointing to updated assumptions around discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and forward P/E as key drivers of this change. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled for January 22, 2026, to review and approve the unaudited standalone financial results for the quarter ended December 31, 2025.",
