      "title": "Investor sentiment improves as stock rises 16%",
      "body": "After last week's 16% share price gain to ₹1,010, the stock trades at a forward P/E ratio of 26x. Average forward P/E is 32x in the Capital Markets industry in India. Total returns to shareholders of 205% over the past three years. Simply Wall St's valuation model estimates the intrinsic value at ₹473 per share.",
