      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-01-23T11:26:59.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues exceed analyst expectations",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹9.33 (up from ₹7.78 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹5.62b (up 16% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹2.70b (up 20% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 48% (up from 46% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 1.3%. Earnings per share (EPS) also surpassed analyst estimates by 4.6%. Revenue is forecast to grow 11% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 16% growth forecast for the Capital Markets industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 18% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 22% per year.",
